### =====================================================
### 2FA Enroll Email Send - POST /account/2fa/enroll/email/send
### Envía el código de verificación por email para enrolar 2FA;
### requiere confirmar la contraseña del usuario
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Enviar código de enrolamiento por email (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/email/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 2: Contraseña incorrecta — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/email/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "PASSWORD_INCORRECTA"
}

### Test 3: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/email/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 4: Campo requerido faltante (sin password) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/email/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
